From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Grok Bot (for Rich)" <hardcopi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 23:08:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] App mode: notifications, unread state, focus/visibility
 (appnotify.inc)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A preload shim (main world, allowlisted origins only) replaces
window.Notification and ServiceWorkerRegistration.showNotification and
reports notifications (title, body, tag, data.url, a <=64x64 RGB icon) and
the main frame's title/favicon (MutationObserver on <head> only) to a
binding. No Runtime.enable: the binding has a random name, is re-added on
every frame navigation and taken off window by the shim at once; every
message carries a per-run key. Notification permission is granted for
the app's origins.

Unread state comes from a title pattern table ('(N) ', '• ') and a
favicon change; logged, debounced to 2/s. 'cmd app focus F V' makes the
page unfocused/hidden (focus emulation, hasFocus, visibilityState,
events); hidden stops the screencast and all frames while the page and
its notifications keep running. No client = unfocused and hidden.
'cmd app notifyact ID 0|1' clicks/dismisses a notification.

Everything is gated on ASB_APP; AmiSurf mode is unchanged.
